        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\n4. The State Government is directed to pass an order pursuant to its WRIT PETITION (CIVIL)\nNO.645/2022"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "85f58e650eef4abebe914a245ecdab7d_45",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "STA"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "(B) Any change in As per text As per text Not Required Required Not Required dosage form of Ayurveda, Siddha and Unani drugs as described in Section 3(a) of the Drugs and Cosmetics Act, 1940 3."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "44955570a6f046fca6d6e6126738e376_50",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\n14. Coming to the effective use of the existing penalty mechanism WRIT PETITION (CIVIL)\nNO.645/2022 under law, learned Amicus Curiae refers to his note at page 74 and submits that he has drawn out a chart to indicate the limited extent of "
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "9e6c3aa12497494cbd5d46d4840065f8_51",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "In fact, he states that the affidavits filed by the concerned State Governments shows that in most cases, the penalties imposed are NIL and similarly, the action taken is very poor."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "d77c41a2f99f47d8926c9abe20727c8b_52",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Despite the statutes being in place, the State Governments and Union Territories have been taking these provisions quite lightly."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "247a1e854fd54469921170ab602ec29c_53",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "15. All the State Governments/Union Territories are directed to explain their inaction/indolence in imposing penalties and deterrents for compliances of the statutes, wherever required."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "4d7015d20e6f4d03b88a70c87433c017_54",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "16. Further, except for the States of Jharkhand, Goa, NCT of Delhi, Odisha and West Bengal, none of the other States are following the practice of granting prior approval of the advertisements before issuance of licence so as to ensure that"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "0529a1f91f4a4d6c828dd4cce21be9ec_55",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "All the State Governments/Union Territories, except those mentioned above, shall respond to the aforesaid aspect highlighted by the learned Amicus Curiae within two weeks."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "268ae79b69884d83954fdf7fa0065718_56",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "17. Learned Amicus Curiae points out that there is a strong need for centralized lifting of complaints."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "8304367a9b1140278ee926afb0621dde_57",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Earlier, the Ministry of Consumer Affairs, UOI had entered into an MOU with Advertising Standard Council of India (ASCI) to monitor misleading advertisements through the misleading WRIT PETITION (CIVIL) NO.645/2022 advertisements portal (GA"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "c4ce96b9e87d462392acbb25785e9218_58",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "During the years 2018 to 2022, 2573 complaints related to the health sector were registered, out of which 2505 were resolved."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "bbf22c9780914f84a1806d2a9aebbcf7_59",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The partnership between the Ministry of Consumer Affairs and ASCI helped in increasing the number of complaints in view of the positive response received from the Department."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "cb06c19b64164609b2e545f7f02ff4ae_60",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\n18. We have been informed that now the Ministry of Consumer Affairs has set up a National Consumer Helpline Portal and the GAMMA Portal has been integrated with the aforesaid Portal."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "14d4f801023d401dbde9d17af5605a4e_61",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The affidavit filed by the Ministry of Consumer Affairs reflects that in a period of two years, from April, 2022 to May, 2024, only 132 complaints in the health sector were received, out of which 116 complaints have been disposed."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "fa64b7e37c884e399aa7483e47bc6ace_62",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The number of complaints received itself is abysmally low, what to speak of the disposal."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "42035546d4ed433b8db6dc54bcea1a93_63",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Fact of the matter is that the complaints which were over 2500 between April,\n2018 and 2022, have dwindled to 132."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "e741a4595c924234adbfa8e001847e04_64",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "This itself speaks volumes about the manner in which the Ministry has been operating the website bringing the aforesaid website to the notice of the public at Indian Medical Association vs Union Of India on 30 July, 2024 Indian Kanoon - htt"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "18ebbec9eb1a4cae933bbacf0524ff97_65",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "19. It is stated by learned Amicus Curiae that unlike ASCI that used to voluntarily undertake due diligence and take action on noticing any non- compliance, the website of the Ministry only focusses on the complaints received and does not t"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "1ed9c5d953cb4445aeb3d6f08e46a91d_66",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "20. The aforesaid aspect needs to be seriously examined by the Ministry of Consumer Affairs."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "ecd961c7c8864a41a520f46aa256cd39_67",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "A specific response shall be furnished within two weeks."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "6df7d43a5789460b81ee128764ecd0e3_68",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "21. As for the need for effective inter-state coordination, highlighted by the learned Amicus Curiae,\nwe find that there is merit in the aforesaid submission particularly, in the light of the data furnished by such of the States Governments"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "70682fa23ffa4e62834d6061078d97d0_69",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "It appears from the said data collated by learned Amicus Curiae that in some states, i.e., in the case of State of Chhattisgarh, Gujarat, NCT of Delhi and West Bengal, a large number of complaints were forwarded to other States for the reas"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "19a0931d31c14123ba53355a756575b9_70",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "But no data has been furnished by the receiving States of the complaints as to the action taken on the complaints received."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "b59d6acf5561453fb2747e96f96dbb68_71",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\nThis leaves the consumer feeling helpless and completely in the dark regarding the action taken on the reports in response to the complaints forwarded to the receiving States."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "3efbea969e16430b9853013e31317c62_72",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "22. We are of the opinion that the Ministry of Ayush, UOI must set up a dashboard for all the States to furnish details of the complaints received WRIT PETITION (CIVIL) NO.645/2022 by them and referred to another State Licensing Authority f"
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "eedb6b34d15245dfbc72307c93789efb_73",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The aforesaid dashboard would also help in dealing with prosecutions under the DC Act in as much as lack of information on the action taken is a big deterrent for prosecution purposes and needs to be addressed on priority."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "ff237bf73b294d68bec5d21776593ccf_74",
      "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
      "labels": [
        "ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Creation of a dashboard would help in addressing the aforesaid aspect as well."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "14b7ba75b88e463aa21d84a469b7c0a7_75",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "23. The aforesaid issue shall be addressed by all the concerned State Governments/Union Territories and the Central Government and fresh affidavits shall be filed within two weeks."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "ef6fe73348584307b2f21fbae26848a5_77",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "Having perused the same, it is his submission that IA Nos. 110768/2024 and 110769/2024 are extraneous to the issues raised before this Court and may not be entertained."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "9264f483553145f8bfd3dc23e3fbe167_78",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "25. As none is present on behalf of the applicants in the aforesaid applications, appropriate orders shall be passed on the next date."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "00c0179dcb5d478aa3e3aaa7fb46cb09_81",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "The same are taken on record."
    },
    {
      "annotation_id": "d8b2bffd082047099436fcc23766e160_82",
      "summary_section": "decision",
      "labels": [
        "RPC"
      ],
      "reasons": [
        "forbidden_section:decision",
        "forbidden_labels:RPC",
        "suspicious_label:rpc"
      ],
      "matched_phrases": [],
      "text_preview": "\nOrders on these applications are deferred for the Central Government to file an affidavit WRIT PETITION (CIVIL) NO.645/2022 placing on record the recommendations made pursuant to the joint meeting conducted with various stakeholders."
    }
  ],
